<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Vérification requise</title>
<style>body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f5f9;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:560px;margin:40px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}.header{background:#1A2E35;padding:32px 40px;text-align:center}.logo{color:#FFB52E;font-size:26px;font-weight:800}.body{padding:40px}.badge{background:#fee2e2;border-radius:50%;width:64px;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 24px;font-size:32px}.h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1A2E35;margin:0 0 12px;text-align:center}.p{font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center}.motif{background:#fef2f2;border-left:4px solid #ef4444;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:14px;color:#dc2626}.btn{display:block;width:fit-content;margin:0 auto;background:#1A2E35;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none}.footer{background:#f8fafc;padding:20px 40px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8}</style></head>
<body><div class="wrap">
  <div class="header"><div class="logo">BeOwn</div></div>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="badge">⚠️</div>
    <p class="h1">Action requise, {{prenom}}</p>
    <p class="p">Votre dossier de vérification d'identité nécessite des corrections.</p>
    <div class="motif"><strong>Motif :</strong> {{motif}}</div>
    <p class="p">Veuillez soumettre à nouveau vos documents en vous connectant à votre espace BeOwn.</p>
    <a href="{{appUrl}}" class="btn">Mettre à jour mon dossier</a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">© BeOwn — Investissement immobilier fractionné</div>
</div></body></html>
